# =============================================================================
# .trivyignore — triaged base-image (distroless) OS CVEs.
#
# These HIGH CVEs are in Debian 12 OS packages inside
# gcr.io/distroless/python3-debian12:nonroot. Fixed UPSTREAM in Debian but not
# yet in the current distroless rebuild, so NOT patchable by us (distroless has
# no package manager). All are DoS / parser issues not reachable via this
# service's request path. Application dependencies are scanned + gated at 0 by
# the pip-audit job. Accepted + time-boxed — re-scan drops each entry once
# distroless rebuilds with deb12u7/u8.  Review by: 2026-11-01.
# =============================================================================
