# krb5 — integer-underflow DoS
CVE-2026-40356
# cpython — http.client excessive-read DoS
CVE-2025-13836
# cpython — XML DTD stack overflow; no XML parsing
CVE-2026-4224
# cpython — decompression use-after-free
CVE-2026-6100
# openssl — PKCS7_verify use-after-free; no PKCS7 verify path
CVE-2026-45447
